# DIRECTIVE ZERO — AM-02 sshd_config
# Key-only auth on :22. The wellness user has no password — the only way
# in is the id_rsa private key stolen via anonymous FTP.

Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes

ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server